      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Just a field of three which will suit the racing pattern of JUNGLE RHYTHM (2) in the opener. Scored convincingly first-up over 1100m here then couldn't get involved against some smart types in town last start. Should be very tough to hold out this time. AVGAS (4) overcame a tardy start to get up for second on debut recently over 1100m at Mackay. Nicely placed over an extra 100m today and can go one better without surprising. DOUBTWILLY (3) started at big odds and ran accordingly first-up at Doomben a fortnight ago. Strips fitter and with little pressure here could give them something to catch.",
